# `sum` of integers checks for overflow.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize total = sum(9000000000000000000)
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `sum` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:2:21
  |
2 | | summarize total = sum(9000000000000000000)
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
